<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyer on Japan stocks via Big Four.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyer on Japan stocks via Big Four.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors via Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Wednesday showed a net buying stance of 1.5 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors placed 9.0 million shares of sell orders against buy orders which totalled 10.5 million shares.</p>
</text>
